{"unit_id":"lbl61__dsh-drop-in#card-zh","repo":"lbl61/dsh-drop-in","commit":"37929393b211b899a6d679d003eaff7240968657","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drop-in 是一个面向 DSH Web 聊天界面的文件拖入插件。它在输入框上方显示可移除的文件栏，也能在光标处插入原生文件引用；发送后，文件路径随消息提供，并在用户消息气泡中显示为文件卡片。主要功能包括拖放和粘贴文件、按会话整理待发送文件、复制无路径文件到工作区，以及通过 dropped_files 工具查询未发送文件。适合需要把本机文件交给 DSH 会话处理的用户。Desktop 绝对路径需要额外安装 preload 路径桥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:706-754","lib/index.js:219-281","scripts/install-preload-bridge.mjs:29-60"]}
{"unit_id":"lbl61__dsh-drop-in#card-en","repo":"lbl61/dsh-drop-in","commit":"37929393b211b899a6d679d003eaff7240968657","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-drop-in adds file drop and paste to DSH Web chat. Files appear as chips or inline references, travel with submitted messages, and render as file cards. The dropped_files tool lists pending files. Pathless files can be copied into the session workspace. Desktop needs a preload bridge for paths.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:706-754","lib/index.js:219-281","scripts/install-preload-bridge.mjs:29-60"]}
